  "prompt": "Show the paying share of each signup cohort from January to June 2025 in its first four months, one row per cohort month that has signups. A user's cohort month is the month of signup_ts, in UTC, and a user counts as paying in a month with at least one payment that was not refunded, by the UTC month of paid_at. Month 0 is the cohort month itself, month 1 the next calendar month, and so on. Each share is the cohort's paying users that month divided by all the users who signed up that month, as a fraction between 0 and 1. All these months have ended by the as-of date, 5 January 2026, so a month with no paying user shows 0. Return five columns, in this order: cohort_month (the first day of the month), m0, m1, m2 and m3. Any row order is fine.",
